    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>{{ site.name }} is an SEO service based in {{ site.location }}. We are the controller of the personal data collected through this website. You can contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or on {{ site.phone }}.</p>

    <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact form.</strong> Your name, email address, website address (optional), the region you are based in and your message. We use it to reply to your enquiry and to discuss our services with you. Our legal basis is our legitimate interest in answering enquiries, and steps you ask us to take before entering into a contract.</li>
      <li><strong>Email and WhatsApp.</strong> If you email or message us, we keep the conversation so we can respond and keep records of our work together.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics (only if you accept).</strong> If you click Accept on our cookie banner, we use Google Analytics 4 to measure how visitors use the site, for example which pages are viewed. Our legal basis is your consent, which you can withdraw at any time.</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting logs.</strong> Our host, Netlify, processes technical data such as your IP address when you request a page, in order to deliver and secure the site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="cookies">Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
    <p>Nothing from Google Analytics loads until you accept. If you decline, no analytics cookies are set. Our fonts are hosted on this site, so your browser does not contact Google Fonts.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>gsv-consent</strong> (local storage, our site): remembers whether you accepted or declined analytics, so we do not ask on every page. Strictly necessary for the banner to work.</li>
      <li><strong>_ga and _ga_*</strong> (cookies, Google Analytics, set only after you accept): distinguish visitors and sessions. They expire after up to two years.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can change your choice at any time with the "Cookie settings" link in the footer of every page.</p>

    <h2>Who we share data with</h2>
    <p>We use a small number of service providers to run the site and our business: Netlify (hosting and form handling), Google (analytics, if you accept), and our email provider. They process data on our behalf and under their own privacy terms. We do not sell your personal data.</p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>We work from Pakistan and our providers operate in several countries, including the United States. If you contact us from Europe, the United Kingdom or Australia, your data will be transferred outside your country. Where required, we rely on the safeguards our providers offer, such as standard contractual clauses.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep data</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiry emails and form submissions for as long as needed to deal with your request and for our business records, and delete them on request unless we need to keep them for legal reasons. Analytics data is kept for the retention period set in our Google Analytics account.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access your personal data, correct it, delete it, restrict or object to its use, receive a copy of it, and withdraw consent at any time. To use any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. You also have the right to complain to your data protection authority: for example the Information Commissioner's Office in the United Kingdom, your national supervisory authority in the European Union, or the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner in Australia.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change how we handle personal data, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>
